# Crystal Imperium balance test: Bugsy (trainer 404) at the badge-1 level cap (16).
# Team: Quilava / Geodude / Flaaffy / Pidgey, no items, never switching voluntarily
# (a deliberately naive line). Five battles with different RNG must include at least one win
# (winnable with Pokemon caught before Azalea) and at least one loss (not a free badge).
!new_game()
!battle_style_set()
!give_mon(156, 16)
!give_mon(74, 16)
!give_mon(180, 16)
!give_mon(16, 16)
savestate team.ss
!battle_trainer(404)
wait 1100
expect16 {gBattleMons+136} 167 bugsy_leads_spinarak
# Quilava Ember, Geodude Rock Throw, Flaaffy Thunder Shock, Pidgey Gust
!sample_battle(404, "2,3,1,2", runs=5, min_wins=1, max_wins=4)
